    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d650">

                <pb facs="0784" n="692" xml:id="pg692"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/10132</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-24T08:00:00-05:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1918, 8 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.41 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Congressional resolution authorizing and Executive decree proclaiming that a
                    state of war exists with German Government, both dated yesterday, published
                    today; officially given out as well, that Germans will not be molested in either
                    person or property. In the-decree it is declared that Costa Rica enters war for
                    principles of humanity. No specific causes alleged. Decrees by mail.<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d650-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
